# telemetry

A pnpm + Turborepo + Changesets monorepo of generic, reusable telemetry packages for services.

- `packages/readthrough`: Go core, read-through cache protection over `cachestore.CacheStore`.
- `packages/readthrough/prom`: separate Go module, Prometheus `Observer`.
- Each Go module has a `package.json` shim for Changesets and Turborepo scripts; never published.

Process is defined in `.ai/`; read it rather than guessing:

- Committing and changesets: `.ai/skills/commit-strategy/SKILL.md`
- Issues, branches and PRs: `.ai/skills/pr-strategy/SKILL.md`
- What depends on what: `.ai/references/dependency-graph/README.md`

Always: keep packages free of product concepts; keep observability backends out of core modules;
treat cache errors as misses; jitter every TTL inside the package; hash secrets/PII before using
them in keys; run `pnpm turbo run build lint check-types test`; one issue per PR with one
`Closes #n`.
Never: hand-edit `.changeset/config.json`'s `ignore` list, or push to `main`.
